[
  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186100869,
      "id": "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140",
      "title": "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "2a2e1473-5a9b-5542-90cf-07b22f1e6bd1",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$L=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 1 & -5 & 8 & -2 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 5 & -6 & -1 \\\\ -2 & -7 & 4 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 6 & 2 & -5 & -3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$N=\\begin{bmatrix}9 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $L,M,$ and $N?$\n\nI. The product $NL$ is well defined\n\nII. The product $ML$ is well defined\n\nIII. The product $LM$ is well defined",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that $L$ is a $1\\times 4$ row vector, $M$ is a $4\\times 5$ matrix, and $N$ is a $5\\times 1$ column vector.\n\nThere is $1$ column in $N$ and $1$ row in $L.$ Since the number of columns in $N$ equals the number of rows in $L,$ the matrices $N$ and $L$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{N}_{5\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{L}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $5$ columns in $M$ and $1$ row in $L.$ Since the number of columns in $M$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $L,$ the matrices $M$ and $L$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{M}_{4\\times 5}{\\times }_{\\ne }{L}_{1\\times 4}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $4$ columns in $L$ and $4$ rows in $M.$ Since the number of columns in $L$ equals the number of rows in $M,$ the matrices $L$ and $M$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{L}_{1\\times \\boxed{\\text{4}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{M}_{\\boxed{\\text{4}}\\times 5}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nTherefore, statements I and III are true, while statement II is false.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "4bf5605a-be9a-5603-bd0a-321c3938bc43",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "40adb348-7ce6-569f-a8bc-cfa8a79dda38",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "b69c819b-b87e-58fe-9ecc-7e77d54858c4",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "5eafa63a-a551-5847-8057-9372939b2898",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "deae9042-c53a-5edd-974a-f3a511703b37",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "f4a9b96f-7827-51df-ad08-97590548d3c4",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "III only"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "5eafa63a-a551-5847-8057-9372939b2898"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
