  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186100869,
      "id": "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140",
      "title": "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "d6700498-2b1c-5fea-bddc-053a8d89df67",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$P=\\begin{bmatrix}9 & -4 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$S=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & -2 & 3 & -5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 8 & 6 & 9\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $P,R,$ and $S?$\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that $P$ is a $1\\times 3$ row vector, $R$ is a $1\\times 2$ row vector, and $S$ is a $2\\times 5$ matrix.\n\nThere are $2$ columns in $R$ and $2$ rows in $S.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ equals the number of rows in $S,$ the matrices $R$ and $S$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{1\\times \\boxed{\\text{2}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{S}_{\\boxed{\\text{2}}\\times 5}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $3$ columns in $P$ and $1$ row in $R.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $R,$ the matrices $P$ and $R$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{1\\times 3}{\\times }_{\\ne }{R}_{1\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $5$ columns in $S$ and $1$ row in $R.$ Since the number of columns in $S$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $R,$ the matrices $S$ and $R$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{S}_{2\\times 5}{\\times }_{\\ne }{R}_{1\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nThe product $RS$ is well defined. The products $PR$ and $SR$ are undefined.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "5b52a33d-2b25-543c-92e5-56daa7544dfd",
          ":answer-field/key": "The product $RS$ is well defined.",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "4ca2b439-2911-5ade-96b5-b4c775052abc",
